@baseUrl = http://localhost:5080
@vulnerabilityId = 00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000
@scanId = 00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000

### Create vulnerability; copy returned id into vulnerabilityId
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/vulnerabilities
Content-Type: application/json

{"name":"SQL injection","severity":"Critical"}

### Get vulnerability
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/vulnerabilities/{{vulnerabilityId}}

### Queue scan; copy returned id into scanId
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/scans
Content-Type: application/json

{"repositoryUrl":"https://gitlab.com/example/project.git"}

### Get all scans ordered by status and creation time
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/scans

### Get status/result
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/scans/{{scanId}}

### Cancel queued or running scan
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/scans/{{scanId}}/cancel

### Validation error
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/vulnerabilities
Content-Type: application/json

{"name":" ","severity":"Unknown"}
